    "scale_anchor_mm": 150,
    "assembly_notes": "The main member (24) is a U-shaped bracket with upper and lower parallel extensions whose aligned pintle-pin holes lie on a vertical hinge axis. A smaller U-shaped link member (26) nests between the extensions and is pivotally pinned via the pintle pin (22) to the main member. The door-half member (12), modeled as a larger U channel with a bight and two sidewalls, mounts to the link through the leaf flange (64) whose pin hole also receives the pintle pin, producing the lift-off hinge action."
  }
